[SZoneTips2231]
sMessage_ATT[0]="This Disk is the Sixth Objective. Its drop-off point is located inside the spies spawn point and there are many routes that the spy can use to reach it."
sMessage_ATT[1]=""
sMessage_DEF[0]=""
sMessage_DEF[1]=""

[SZoneTips250]
sMessage_ATT[0]="In this mission, there are 6 possible objectives to hack. To win you will need to neutralize 4 of them."
sMessage_ATT[1]=""
sMessage_DEF[0]=""
sMessage_DEF[1]=""

[SZoneTips258]
sMessage_ATT[0]="Five of these objectives are computer terminals to neutralize. The Sixth is a disk that you must retrieve."
sMessage_ATT[1]=""
sMessage_DEF[0]=""
sMessage_DEF[1]=""

[SZoneTips267]
sMessage_ATT[0]="The means to pass from one building to the other are numerous. Zip Lines, Sewers, Corridors . . ."
sMessage_ATT[1]=""
sMessage_DEF[0]=""
sMessage_DEF[1]=""

[SZoneTips275]
sMessage_ATT[0]="This is the shop, and in here you will find your First Mission Objective."
sMessage_ATT[1]=""
sMessage_DEF[0]=""
sMessage_DEF[1]=""

[SZoneTips283]
sMessage_ATT[0]="This is the office and is where the 2nd mission objective is located. Notice that while you hacking, Mercs can use the window to snipe or grenade this room."
sMessage_ATT[1]=""
sMessage_DEF[0]=""
sMessage_DEF[1]=""

[SZoneTips296]
sMessage_ATT[0]="Hack this panel to close the shutters for 30 seconds and protect yourself while hacking the objectives in this building."
sMessage_ATT[1]=""
sMessage_DEF[0]=""
sMessage_DEF[1]=""

[SZoneTips305]
sMessage_ATT[0]="Here is the living room, which holds the 3rd Objective."
sMessage_ATT[1]=""
sMessage_DEF[0]=""
sMessage_DEF[1]=""

[SZoneTips313]
sMessage_ATT[0]="Here is the lab and the 4th objective. Notice the Molotov Cocktail, you can use this to set fire to a mercenary and kill him."
sMessage_ATT[1]=""
sMessage_DEF[0]=""
sMessage_DEF[1]=""

[SZoneTips321]
sMessage_ATT[0]="In this old Kitchen, you'll see the 5th Objective."
sMessage_ATT[1]=""
sMessage_DEF[0]=""
sMessage_DEF[1]=""

[SZoneTips329]
sMessage_ATT[0]="Destroy the glass in front of you with your weapon, but remember that doing this will allow Merc grenades to pass through."
sMessage_ATT[1]=""
sMessage_DEF[0]=""
sMessage_DEF[1]=""

[SZoneTips338]
sMessage_ATT[0]="To attain the 6th objective, you must destroy the wall of the farthest building. To do so, activate the crane using this panel."
sMessage_ATT[1]=""
sMessage_DEF[0]=""
sMessage_DEF[1]=""

